Error [E0398]: This arithmetic spelling is retired; use `bit_or`
  --> <corelib>/Core/crypto/crypto.jet:1:23
    |
  1 | fn run() { value :: 1 | 2 }
    |                       ^
 Why: Marks express ownership and outcomes; arithmetic uses named methods (D-SIGIL-ALGEBRA1=B)
 Fix: Write `value.bit_or(other)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0398
